WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.792 --> 00:00:03.959
NICK FURY
Captain Rambeau...

00:00:04.709 --> 00:00:06.209
...what the hell are you doing?

00:00:06.834 --> 00:00:08.834
MONICA RAMBEAU
Entering the jump point perimeter.

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:11.250
I'm gonna get you some readings, Fury.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:12.533
NICK FURY
What...

00:00:12.584 --> 00:00:13.324
MONICA RAMBEAU
Hello?

00:00:13.375 --> 00:00:14.269
NICK FURY
Monica?

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:14.919
MONICA RAMBEAU
Hello?

00:00:17.292 --> 00:00:18.325
[Screaming]

00:00:18.375 --> 00:00:19.367
KAMALA KHAN
Oh my God, oh my God,

00:00:19.417 --> 00:00:20.450
oh my God, oh my God!

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.334
NICK FURY
Captain Rambeau?

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:25.459
KAMALA KHAN
[Screaming] Please help!

00:00:27.542 --> 00:00:29.250
Nick Fury! Hi!

00:00:30.626 --> 00:00:32.542
Is this an Avengers test?

00:00:32.959 --> 00:00:34.959
NICK FURY
Where's Captain Rambeau?

00:00:35.417 --> 00:00:38.409
♫ ["Intergalactic"
by Beastie Boys playing] ♫

00:00:38.459 --> 00:00:39.626
MONICA RAMBEAU
Wait a minute!

00:00:47.083 --> 00:00:47.667
CAROL DANVERS
What the...

00:00:47.751 --> 00:00:51.117
♫ Well, now,
don't you tell me to smile ♫

00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:53.959
♫ You stick around
I'll make it worth your while ♫

00:00:54.042 --> 00:00:54.868
MONICA RAMBEAU
Hi.

00:00:54.918 --> 00:00:56.742
NICK FURY
We're looking for Kamala Khan.

00:00:56.792 --> 00:00:58.834
KAMALA KHAN
[Gasps] Did I get in?

00:01:00.209 --> 00:01:02.375
MONICA RAMBEAU
Okay so, our powers are entangled.

00:01:02.918 --> 00:01:05.659
I can manipulate light
energy and you...

00:01:05.709 --> 00:01:06.459
KAMALA KHAN
