00:01:06.542 --> 00:01:07.209
ALL
No!

00:01:07.292 --> 00:01:08.042
Kamala!

00:01:09.174 --> 00:01:11.041
CAROL DANVERS
Ugh! Not again!

00:01:11.918 --> 00:01:12.617
Hi.

00:01:12.667 --> 00:01:13.751
MUNEEBA KHAN
Where is our daughter?

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:15.375
MONICA RAMBEAU
Wherever you were.

00:01:22.292 --> 00:01:24.375
KAMALA KHAN
Oh my God!

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:26.167
♪♪

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:37.459
NICK FURY
Shields up!

00:01:38.042 --> 00:01:39.042
[Screaming]

00:01:45.167 --> 00:01:45.742
KAMALA KHAN
We're a team?

00:01:45.792 --> 00:01:46.659
MONICA RAMBEAU
Oh, no, no, no, we're not a team.

00:01:46.709 --> 00:01:47.534
CAROL DANVERS
We're not a team.

00:01:47.584 --> 00:01:48.117
[Kamala gasps]

00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:50.459
♪♪

00:01:54.709 --> 00:01:55.584
♫ Do it ♫

